**Everything runs in Docker.** Rust is not needed on the host and `cargo` must not be run there: `target/` and the crate cache live in Docker volumes and contain Linux builds. Run every command below inside the dev container:

- `sh scripts/dev.sh` → `docker compose up dev`;
- any other command → `docker compose run --rm dev <command>`, e.g. `docker compose run --rm dev sh scripts/check.sh` or `docker compose run --rm dev cargo add <crate>`;
- the production image: `docker compose run --rm --build app <args>` (see Docker below).
